---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Price Scraper Web App | Miller Arias"
  description="Streamlit web app for multi-store price scraping with CSV/Excel export."
>
  <main
    class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-16 md:mt-24"
    transition:name="card-project-pricescraper"
  >
    <a
      href="/proyectos"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 text-sm font-mono text-neutral-500 hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors group"
    >
      <span class="inline-block transform group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform">
        ←
      </span>
      Back to projects
    </a>

    <header class="mb-12 mt-11">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/20 text-purple-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
          Web Scraping
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          Data Collection
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 text-neutral-400 text-xs font-mono rounded-full">
          2025
        </span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-100 mb-6">
        Price Scraper Web App
      </h1>
      <p class="text-neutral-400 text-lg leading-relaxed">
        Streamlit web app for comparing prices across multiple online stores.
        Dynamic JSON configuration, BeautifulSoup extraction, automatic export
        to CSV/Excel, and logging for debugging.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/Miller1999/price-scraper"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-300 hover:text-white border border-neutral-800 hover:border-neutral-700 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition active:scale-[0.99]"
        >
          <span>View Repository on GitHub</span>
          <span class="text-neutral-600">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <hr class="border-neutral-900 my-12" />

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Tech Stack
      </h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Python
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Streamlit
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          BeautifulSoup4
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Requests
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          Pandas
        </span>
        <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-full text-xs text-neutral-200 font-mono">
          OpenPyXL
        </span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Supported Stores
      </h2>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-200 font-semibold">Amazon</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs mt-1">Global</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-200 font-semibold">Mercado Libre Colombia</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs mt-1">CO</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-4 rounded-2xl text-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-200 font-semibold">Falabella Colombia</p>
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-xs mt-1">CO</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-[5.5rem]">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-6">
        Key Features
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Intuitive Web Interface
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Built with Streamlit for quick use without complexity. Just enter a
            URL, select a store, and get the price instantly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Dynamic Configuration
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            CSS selectors per store are defined in `stores.json`, making it easy
            to add new sites without modifying the core logic.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Automatic Export
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Automatically generates `results.csv` and `results.xlsx` with search
            history for later analysis.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-900 p-5 rounded-2xl">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-200 mb-2">
            Logging & Robustness
          </h3>
          <p class="text-neutral-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Complete logging system for troubleshooting with error handling and
            clear user feedback.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="mt-24 pt-8 border-t border-neutral-800 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500">
        Miller Arias • Price Scraper Web App • 2025
      </p>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Layout>
